mw2coop patch for maps/_load.gsc (Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build)

1. Start the co-op campaign framework (it does nothing outside a co-op campaign session).
@@@ replace
	if ( is_coop() )
		maps\_coop::main();
@@@ with
	if ( is_coop() )
		maps\_coop::main();

	maps\_mw2coop::main();
@@@ end

Minimal loader/compiler probe. The context line belongs to the game owner.
Executed after level.players has been initialized, including on single-player.
An allocated capacity of 3 must still report players=1 in this offline smoke.
@@@ replace
	level notify( "level.players initialized" );
@@@ with
	maps\_mw2trio_probe::players_ready( level.players );
	level notify( "level.players initialized" );
@@@ end
